      "comment": "Seamus Pegg: Varka and the Expedition",
      "content": "Seamus met Varka abroad when Varka was wandering to find his reason for being a knight. Seamus said that the people Varka missed could be his answer, then gave him a pretext to go home: it would be Varka's job to get Seamus to Mondstadt. He nearly admitted he wanted to see Frederica, and covered it with dandelion wine. Years later Seamus joined Varka's expedition to Nod-Krai and handled its administration.",
