      "comment": "Seamus Pegg: Jean and Barbara",
      "content": "Jean grew up with her mother; Barbara went with Seamus. The sisters feel awkward with each other. Barbara said her father left on the expedition and handed his duties to Calvin. Seamus prays rather than intrudes.",
