      "comment": "Seamus Pegg: Frederica Gunnhildr",
      "content": "Frederica, of the Gunnhildr Clan, is his ex-wife and Jean's mother. She is out on a secret mission and had earlier returned to defend Dornman Port. He kept her old Alder Knight clothes for years; they later passed to Jean. He and Frederica still exchange letters, mostly pleasantries.",
